1
00:00:05,400 --> 00:00:07,646
The moon could not sleep.

2
00:00:07,950 --> 00:00:11,398
It tossed, and it turned, and it counted sheep.

3
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:18,350
Down below, someone else was awake, too.

4
00:00:20,300 --> 00:00:23,541
So she climbed up, up, up, onto the roof,

5
00:00:24,700 --> 00:00:27,720
and sang the softest song she knew.

6
00:00:40,100 --> 00:00:42,927
And at last, the moon fell asleep.

7
00:00:49,100 --> 00:00:50,972
Night, night.
